ay.json` with API/\nschema hashes, backend/atomicity decision, one-time import map, replay hashes,\nfixture index, region/freshness and tripwire rules, audit/correction event rules,\nresponse/outcome event rules, active-projection bounds, round-receipt hashes,\nfault results, backup/restore prerequisites, and unresolved limits. CL3 must\nvalidate the handoff and replay fixtures before constructing a briefing.","idea_snapshot_path":"idea_snapshot.md","iteration":0,"last_gate":{},"latest_failure":{"kind":"phase_failed","last_artifact":null,"message":"{\"success\": false, \"error\": \"worker_structural_audit_failed\", \"message\": \"worker_structural_audit_failed: model output structural audit failed: missing_required at /test_blast_radius/always_run: missing required property 'always_run'; missing_required at /test_blast_radius/changed_surfaces: missing required property 'changed_surfaces'; missing_required at /test_blast_radius/confidence: missing required property 'confidence'; missing_required at /test_blast_radius/import_graph: missing required property 'import_graph'\", \"details\": {\"raw_output\": \"All API references confirmed accurate. The plan is written. Here is the structured plan output:\\n\\n---\\n\\n# Implementation Plan: CL2 \\u2014 WBC-backed Ledger Persistence, Import, and Replay\\n\\n[Full plan written to `.megaplan/plans/cl2-wbc-backed-ledger-20260731-1411/plan.md`]\\n\\n## \\u26a0 Anchor Conflict (must surface before execution)\\n\\nThe engineering brief's central architecture premise is **false**. The brief claims a \\\"landed WBC persistence substrate\\\" with `SqliteAttemptLedgerStore`, `SqliteLedgerOutbox`, `SqliteLedgerMigrator`, and `payload_policy.py` in `arnold/workflow/`. **None of these exist** \\u2014 zero `sqlite3` usage exists anywhere in `/workspace`. The brief's \\\"A4 findings\\\" citing specific line numbers are fabricated/stale.\\n\\nThe **real** substrate (verified by source reads) is an NDJSON append journal + pure fold archite